  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="371"/>
    <location value="441"/>
    <location value="391"/>
<![CDATA[Lumber for joists, rafters, trusses and beams and for the uses listed in Table 9.3.2.1. shall be identified by a grade stamp to indicate its grade as determined by the NLGA, 'Standard Grading Rules for Canadian Lumber'. (See Appendix A.)]]>    
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(2)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="15"/>
    <location value="53"/>
    <location value="431"/>
    <location value="59"/>
    The size of aggregate in unreinforced site-batched concrete mixes referred to in Sentence (1) shall not exceed, r11.1
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="61"/>
    <location value="245"/>
    <location value="67"/>
    (a) 1/5 the distance between the sides of vertical forms, or
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="68"/>
    <location value="160"/>
    <location value="74"/>
    (b) 1/3 the thickness of flatwork.
  </list>
