    <location value="264"/>
    <location value="447"/>
    <location value="277"/>
    Except as required in Article 9.9.10.1. and Sentence (3), the minimum window glass area for rooms in buildings of residential occupancy or rooms that are used for sleeping shall conform to Table 9.7.2.3.
