  <heading level="2">
    <location value="60"/>
    <location value="55"/>
    <location value="460"/>
    <location value="71"/>
    9.10.14.5. Construction of Exposing Building Face and Walls Above Exposing Building Face
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="81"/>
    <location value="479"/>
    <location value="102"/>
    Except as provided in Sentences (2) to (7), each exposing building face and any exterior wall located above an exposing building face that encloses an attic or roof space shall be constructed in conformance with Table 9.10.14.5. and Subsection 9.10.8.
  </list>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="163"/>
    <location value="119"/>
    <location value="379"/>
    <location value="124"/>
    Minimum Construction Requirements for Exposing Building Faces
  </heading>
  <table>
    <location value="59"/>
