<![CDATA[Insulating concrete form units shall be manufactured of polystyrene conforming to the performance requirements of CAN/ULC-S701.1 , 'Thermal Insulation, Polystyrene Boards', for Type 2, 3 or 4 polystyrene. r11.1]]>    
