  <heading level="2">
    <location value="60"/>
    <location value="352"/>
    <location value="192"/>
    <location value="359"/>
    9.20.4.  Mortar Joints
  </heading>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="60"/>
    <location value="371"/>
    <location value="163"/>
    <location value="377"/>
    9.20.4.1.  Thickness
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="388"/>
    <location value="481"/>
    <location value="401"/>
    Except as provided in Sentence (2), mortar joint thickness for burned clay brick and concrete masonry units shall be 10 mm.
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(2)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="411"/>
    <location value="330"/>
    <location value="416"/>
    Permitted tolerances in head and bed joints shall be -5 mm to +10 mm.
  </list>
  <page_footer>
    <layer value="furniture"/>
    <location value="234"/>
    <location value="483"/>
    <location value="310"/>
