    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="398"/>
    <location value="453"/>
    <location value="411"/>
    Where the finished flooring consists of not less than 19 mm matched wood strip flooring laid at right angles to joists, spaced not more than 610 mm o.c., subflooring shall be permitted to consist of not less than,
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="413"/>
    <location value="144"/>
    <location value="419"/>
    (a) 12.5 mm thick plywood,
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="421"/>
    <location value="217"/>
    <location value="426"/>
    (b) 12.5 mm thick OSB conforming to O-2 grade,
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="42"/>
