    9.26.2.  Roofing Materials r11.1
  </heading>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="60"/>
    <location value="75"/>
    <location value="207"/>
    <location value="81"/>
    9.26.2.1.  Material Standards
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="92"/>
    <location value="478"/>
    <location value="105"/>
    Where materials used for the preparation of the substrate for roofing are covered in the scope of a standard listed in Table 9.26.2.1.A., they shall conform to that standard.
  </list>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="184"/>
    <location value="117"/>
    <location value="360"/>
    <location value="123"/>
    Materials for Preparation of the Substrate for Roofing
  </heading>
  <table>
    <location value="59"/>
    <location value="137"/>
