<![CDATA[CAN/CGSB- 37.54, 'Polyvinyl Chloride Roofing and Waterproofing Membrane' CAN/CGSB-37.58- M, 'Membrane, Elastomeric, Cold-Applied Liquid, for Non- Exposed Use in Roofing and Waterproofing' ASTM D4637 / D4637M, 'EPDM Sheet Used In Single - Ply Roof Membrane' ASTM D4811, 'Nonvulcanized (Uncured) Rubber Sheet Used as Roof Flashing' ASTM D6878 / D6878M, 'Thermoplastic Polyolefin Based Sheet Roofing']]>    <nl/>
