<![CDATA[CSA A123.1 / A123.5, 'Asphalt Shingles Made From Organic Felt and Surfaced with Mineral Granules / Asphalt Shingles Made From Glass Felt and Surfaced with Mineral Granules' CAN/CSA- A220 Series, 'Concrete Roof Tiles' CSA O118.1, 'Western Red Cedar Shakes and Shingles' CSA O118.2, 'Eastern White Cedar Shingles']]>    <nl/>
