  </page_header>
  <page_header>
    <layer value="furniture"/>
    <location value="160"/>
    <location value="22"/>
    <location value="347"/>
    <location value="28"/>
    2012 Building Code Compendium
  </page_header>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="30"/>
    <location value="55"/>
    <location value="154"/>
    <location value="62"/>
    9.28.4.  Stucco Lath
  </heading>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="30"/>
    <location value="75"/>
    <location value="128"/>
    <location value="81"/>
    9.28.4.1.  Materials
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="92"/>
    <location value="226"/>
    <location value="97"/>
    Rib lath or expanded metal stucco mesh shall be,
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="99"/>
    <location value="298"/>
    <location value="105"/>
    (a) copper-alloy steel coated with rust-inhibitive paint after fabrication, or
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="107"/>
    <location value="101"/>
    <location value="112"/>
    (b) galvanized.
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(2)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="122"/>
    <location value="227"/>
    <location value="127"/>
    Woven or welded wire mesh shall be galvanized.
  </list>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="30"/>
    <location value="139"/>
    <location value="197"/>
    <location value="145"/>
    9.28.4.2.  No Sheathing Required
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="155"/>
    <location value="446"/>
    <location value="176"/>
    Sheathing need not be provided beneath stucco where not less than 1.19 mm diam galvanized wire is applied horizontally to the framing at vertical intervals not exceeding 150 mm, or where paper-backed welded wire metal lath is used.
  </list>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="30"/>
