  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="71"/>
    <location value="323"/>
    <location value="77"/>
    Nails for fastening gypsum board to wood supports shall conform to,
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="79"/>
    <location value="306"/>
    <location value="84"/>
<![CDATA[(a) ASTM F1667, 'Driven Fasteners: Nails, Spikes and Staples', or]]>    
