  <heading level="2">
    <location value="30"/>
    <location value="392"/>
    <location value="267"/>
    <location value="398"/>
    9.32.2.2.  Protection from Weather and Insects
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="409"/>
    <location value="452"/>
    <location value="422"/>
    Openings for natural ventilation other than windows shall be constructed to provide protection from the weather and insects.
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(2)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="431"/>
    <location value="200"/>
    <location value="437"/>
    Screening shall be of rust-proof material.
  </list>
