  <heading level="2">
    <location value="30"/>
    <location value="55"/>
    <location value="170"/>
    <location value="61"/>
    9.32.3.4.  Principal Exhaust
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="42"/>
    <location value="71"/>
    <location value="412"/>
    <location value="84"/>
    A principal exhaust fan shall be installed and shall be rated to provide not less than the capacity given in Table 9.32.3.4.A.
  </list>
  <text>
    <location value="190"/>
    <location value="94"/>
    <location value="292"/>
    <location value="107"/>
    Table 9.32.3.4.A. Principal Exhaust Fan Capacity
  </text>
  <text>
    <location value="183"/>
    <location value="109"/>
    <location value="301"/>
    <location value="114"/>
    Forming Part of Sentence 9.32.3.4.(1)
  </text>
  <table>
    <location value="43"/>
