  </page_header>
  <page_header>
    <layer value="furniture"/>
    <location value="435"/>
    <location value="22"/>
    <location value="488"/>
    <location value="28"/>
    9.32.3.7.
  </page_header>
  <picture>
    <location value="59"/>
    <location value="10"/>
    <location value="121"/>
    <location value="27"/>
  </picture>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(5)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="54"/>
    <location value="475"/>
    <location value="74"/>
    A supply duct from the outdoors to the heat recovery ventilator required in Sentence (3) and a main distribution trunk duct shall be provided and shall be sized according to Part 6, except that the supply duct and the main distribution trunk duct may be sized according to Table 9.32.3.7.A. where,
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="76"/>
    <location value="402"/>
    <location value="81"/>
    (a) the total duct length from the outdoor hood to any supply register does not exceed 21 m, and
    <ldiv/>
    <location value="72"/>
    <location value="83"/>
    <location value="246"/>
    <location value="89"/>
    (b) the total number of fittings does not exceed 8.
  </list>
  <heading level="2">
    <location value="244"/>
    <location value="98"/>
    <location value="300"/>
    <location value="104"/>
