    <location value="33"/>
    <location value="440"/>
    <location value="446"/>
    <location value="453"/>
    <content> Spans apply only where the floors serve residential areas as described in Table 4.1.5.3., or the uniformly distributed live load on the floor does not exceed that specified for residential areas as described in Table 4.1.5.3.</content>
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(2)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="33"/>
    <location value="455"/>
    <location value="261"/>
    <location value="461"/>
    <content> No bridging is assumed for spans for floor joists with concrete topping.</content>
