  <heading level="2">
    <location value="62"/>
    <location value="407"/>
    <location value="131"/>
    <location value="413"/>
    Notes to Table A-17:
  </heading>
  <list class="ordered">
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(1)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="62"/>
    <location value="415"/>
    <location value="276"/>
    <location value="421"/>
    <content><![CDATA[ Deflection criteria is L/240, where 'L' is the clear span of the lintel.]]></content>
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(2)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="62"/>
    <location value="422"/>
    <location value="342"/>
    <location value="428"/>
    Linear interpolation is permitted between ground snow loads and between lintel depths.
    <ldiv>
      <marker>(3)</marker>
    </ldiv>
    <location value="62"/>
    <location value="430"/>
    <location value="474"/>
    <location value="443"/>
<![CDATA[10M stirrups are required at a maximum d/2 spacing for spans greater than 1 200 mm, where 'd' is the distance from the top of the lintel to the level of the bottom reinforcing bar in the lintel.]]>    
  </list>
